# Marchive

cgo-free Go. Module `github.com/martinshaw/marchive-two`. Use `CGO_ENABLED=0` and `GOTOOLCHAIN=local`.

Read only the file for the task. Do not list the repo or open a neighbor to get oriented. In a file over 400 lines, read the one function you are changing.

## One file

- Screen layout and polling: `web/src/App.jsx`
- Menubar, toolbar, sidebar: `web/src/chrome.jsx`
- One screen: `SourcesPane.jsx`, `CapturePane.jsx`, `ReaderPane.jsx`, `WordsPane.jsx`
- Rows, selection, commands, counts: `rows.jsx`, `selection.js`, `commands.js`, `library.js`
- Sheets and the new-source wizard: `Sheets.jsx`, `AddSheet.jsx`
- Tables, splits, menus, details: `Grid.jsx`, `Split.jsx`, `ContextMenu.jsx`, `Message.jsx`, `Words.jsx`
- Styles: `internal/httpapi/static/app.css`. Search for the selector. Do not read the file.
- One HTTP route: `internal/httpapi/server.go`. The route list is the top. Then read that handler.
- Request behavior: `internal/service/service.go`. Removing files: `remove.go`. Item files: `files.go`
- Record types: `internal/store/store.go`. Schema: `schema.go`. Sources: `sources.go`. Schedules and deletes: `schedules.go`. Runs: `runs.go`. Items: `items.go`. Settings: `settings.go`
- One capture kind: `internal/provider/page.go`, `article.go`, `podcast.go`, `x.go`, `hn.go`, `youtube.go`, or `search.go`
- Chrome launch: `internal/browser/browser.go` and `launch_darwin.go`. Page bytes: `archive.go`
- Commands: `internal/cli/cli.go`. Scheduler: `internal/runner/runner.go`. yt-dlp: `internal/ytdlp/ytdlp.go`

Do not read `internal/httpapi/ui/dist` or `web/node_modules`.

## Rebuild

From the repo root. CSS only: `CGO_ENABLED=0 go build -trimpath -ldflags="-s -w" -o marchive ./cmd/marchive`. JavaScript: `make build`. Then `pkill -x marchive` and `./marchive serve`. The port is random. Read the log URL. Do not use `go run`.

Tests: `CGO_ENABLED=0 GOTOOLCHAIN=local go test ./internal/service/ ./internal/store/ -count=1`. Skip `./internal/browser/` unless that package changed.

Live data is `~/Library/Application Support/Marchive`. Do not save Settings, add a source, or confirm Remove unless asked.
